      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do file operations within get_data_file_block - is it OK to do such things within a spinlock? Also the old way was interruptable, this new lock isn\u0027t. Again, is that OK?",
      "revId": "fb1cf81f7dee4e74f63a24d7a300e68f1b395ce0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "afe2ae3a_f398dc3f",
