        "id": 1724998
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-20T16:44:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "read_lock() isn\u0027t a spinlock(). read_lock() is still a blocking call. This function will sleep if there are writers (when blockmap is getting updated. Please see call to incfs_write_data_block_to_backing_file below). get_data_file_block() is reading the blockmap, so it is ok to have multiple readers.",
      "parentUuid": "97188383_b3146a62",
      "revId": "fb1cf81f7dee4e74f63a24d7a300e68f1b395ce0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c4416378_340a0068",
        "filename": "fs/incfs/data_mgmt.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 825,
