        "id": 1724998
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-07-20T16:44:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. You are right; but we don\u0027t need lock here.. the lock here is meant only for reading from the file to update the block. \n\nWe already have per mount mutex lock (mi-\u003emi_pending_reads_mutex) when adding pending reads by multiple readers, so the list is already protected at the mount level. so, it should be safe to release the read lock.",
      "parentUuid": "deeedcdf_9e2f113d",
      "revId": "fb1cf81f7dee4e74f63a24d7a300e68f1b395ce0",
